    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Sci-Fi Builder</strong> \u2014 a third-person sandbox sim where the galaxy said, \u201cGo wild,\u201d and you said, \u201cHold my cosmic wrench.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re the head honcho of a totally empty space station on Planet 1188 in the Centurion Constellation. It\u2019s cold, lonely, and dangerously lacking in funky wall art. Your job? <strong>Turn this metallic void into a thriving colony</strong> full of humanoids, aliens, robots, and whatever else your brain can invent at 3 AM.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udef8 So what do you actually do?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything. Absolutely everything.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design sci-fi rooms with no grid snapping (yes, true freedom!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place and move furniture like a chaotic space god</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repaint your station until it glows like a synthwave album cover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control lighting like you're hosting the Galaxy\u2019s Got Talent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport NPCs like a teleportation-happy wizard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up interactions between creatures, robots, props, or your own character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accidentally create alien soap operas and robot dance battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a full society, then give everyone very questionable jobs</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd16 Characters? You bet.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>hundreds of beings</strong>: humanoids, strange creatures, moody robots \u2014 even the weird guy from Engineering. You can control them, dress them up, make them interact, or just watch them do very unexpected things in the cafeteria.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 What\u2019s in the toolbox?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space furniture, devices, computers, construction parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom color settings for everything from walls to alien shoes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounded rooms with interactive actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full wardrobe customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC personality settings (will your robot be flirty or feral?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No object limits \u2014 if your station starts lagging, that\u2019s on you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80B<strong>ottom line:</strong><br><strong>Sci-Fi Builder</strong> is what happens when creative freedom, sandbox chaos, and sci-fi dreams collide.<br>There are no rules, no real endgame \u2014 just infinite possibilities, alien fashion shows, and maybe a toilet in zero gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So suit up, space architect \u2014 your station needs... <i>whatever this is</i>.</p>",
