li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space furniture, devices, computers, construction parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom color settings for everything from walls to alien shoes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounded rooms with interactive actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full wardrobe customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC personality settings (will your robot be flirty or feral?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No object limits \u2014 if your station starts lagging, that\u2019s on you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80B<strong>ottom line:</strong><br><strong>Sci-Fi Builder</strong> is what happens when creative freedom, sandbox chaos, and sci-fi dreams collide.<br>There are no rules, no real endgame \u2014 just infinite possibilities, alien fashion shows, and maybe a toilet in zero gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So suit up, space architect \u2014 your station needs... <i>whatever this is</i>.</p>",
    "short_description": "Sci-Fi Builder is a sandbox sim where you command aliens, robots, and questionable space furniture to build your dream colony. No rules, no grids, no gravity problems\u2014just you, 1188 ways to go wild, and a space station that desperately needs your weird ideas.",
